%% Sequence: staff draft a brief, review each statement and publish.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor St as Staff reviewer
  participant S as Server
  participant A as Agents
  participant G as Gemini API
  participant C as Citation checker
  participant F as Briefs (files)
  participant Log as Log (SQLite)
  actor R as Resident

  St->>S: POST /api/staff/briefs {decisionId}<br/>Authorization: Bearer token
  S->>S: check token
  S->>Log: append brief.started
  S->>A: draft brief
  A->>G: plan sections (summary, impacts, have your say, lenses)
  loop each section
    A->>G: work on section
    G-->>A: record_statement("Fares rise 5%", quote on p. 12)
    A->>C: check quote on page 12
    Note over C,F: The quote is not on page 12
    C-->>A: rejected: quote not found on that page
    A->>Log: append statement.rejected
    A->>G: rejected, with the reason
    G-->>A: read_page, then record_statement(fixed quote, p. 14)
    A->>C: check quote on page 14
    C-->>A: verified
    A->>Log: append statement.recorded
    A-->>St: SSE progress (steps, statements)
  end
  A->>A: reading grade (Flesch-Kincaid), lens computations
  A->>F: write draft brief (status: draft)
  A->>Log: append brief.generated + usage
  A-->>St: SSE brief, done

  loop each statement
    St->>S: POST /api/staff/review {statementId, action, text?, note?}
    Note right of St: approve, edit (original kept) or reject
    S->>F: update statement review (by, at)
    S->>Log: append statement.reviewed
  end
  St->>S: POST /api/staff/publish {decisionId, reviewer}
  S->>F: status: published (by, at)
  S->>Log: append brief.published
  R->>S: GET /api/decisions/:id
  S-->>R: published brief
  Note over S,R: Shows "Approved by (name), (date)". Rejected statements are not shown.
